  "favourites_count": 3,
  "description": "<h1>Restricted Flea</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>Restrict what’s available on flea based on category</li>\n<li>Disable selling to the flea</li>\n<li>Remove default blacklist</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>Whitelist works on parent categories as well as direct item IDs.</h1>\n<p>The default config only allows you to buy:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Barter Items</li>\n<li>Keys</li>\n<li>Weapons</li>\n<li>Attachments</li>\n<li>Food &amp; Drink</li>\n<li><em>Other</em></li>\n<li><em>Info</em></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Also disables selling to flea and removes the default flea blacklist.</h2>\n",
